---
import ReadingLayout from "../components/ReadingLayout.astro";
---
<ReadingLayout title="About">
  <h1 slot="strip" class="about__title">About</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>I am a researcher and consultant working where science, society and environment meet.</p>
    <p>My doctoral research in planetary health looks at what happens after a governance framework is adopted, and why implementation so often falls short of the commitment on paper.</p>
    <p>Alongside the PhD I advise organisations on governance, reporting and programme design.</p>
    <p>I trained in anthropology and in arts, culture and society in the Netherlands. That background shapes how I work: I look at institutions, incentives and the people who have to make a plan run.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="about__contact"><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></p>
</ReadingLayout>

<style>
  /* The title sits in the glass strip, in ink. */
  .about__title {
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    font-size: var(--text-entry-title);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .about__contact {
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    border-top: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--color-hairline);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }
</style>
